Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.94,0:01:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order for Luffy and Robin\Nto get some rest and recover,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.12,0:01:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Going Mary remained anchored.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:02:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Off the uninhabited island for four days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.80,0:02:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, we set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.96,0:02:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today marks the third morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.90,0:02:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we resumed our voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weather is clear and sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.38,0:02:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mostly spring with\Noccasional bouts of summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.86,0:02:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.22,0:02:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.20,0:02:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,made this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,potato pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.87,0:02:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially for you, mademoiselle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.14,0:02:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.44,0:02:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm, delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.22,0:02:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes me so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.72,0:02:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, keep it down, jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.10,0:02:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some people are trying\Nto sleep around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, cactus head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.82,0:02:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My most sincere apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.30,0:02:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, you cigarette-snorkeling dartboard?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.15,0:02:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you call me? Dartboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.92,0:02:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dartboard eyebrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.56,0:02:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.40,0:02:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lou!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.31,0:02:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lou!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.84,0:03:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for this! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.96,0:03:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is me frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.06,0:03:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this is how he behaves\Nafter almost freezing to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.76,0:03:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.67,0:03:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You nailed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.59,0:03:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what you looked like!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.90,0:03:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you clean all\Nthat up, Luffy. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.02,0:03:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami, is that food?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.34,0:03:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.30,0:03:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some potato pie-y.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Potatoes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.25,0:03:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, make me some.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.52,0:03:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just how many hours a day do you\Nhave to lie around and sleep anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.16,0:03:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll sleep as long as I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.48,0:03:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to fight about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.54,0:04:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is pie, huh? Good\Nstuff. Why is it called Paulie?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.36,0:04:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that because the meat is\Ntaken from the tail of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.82,0:04:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the giant beast by i\Nshould know i was the one
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.64,0:04:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who killed it who's over\Na hundred meters long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.26,0:04:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, a hundred meters?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.02,0:04:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's amazing, Uzzah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.64,0:04:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it all before breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.60,0:04:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you woke up early to kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.48,0:04:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, have you forgotten who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.92,0:04:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.83,0:04:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.82,0:04:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Captain... Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.10,0:04:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the great and almighty Captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.60,0:04:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.16,0:04:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.07,0:04:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.80,0:04:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin, are you feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.00,0:04:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you still have a chill\Nyour treatment helped me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.12,0:04:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tremendously. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.72,0:04:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a wonderful doctor
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.46,0:04:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sure looks happy. Yep,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.82,0:05:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take it easy Robin Loofie's\Nalready recovered enough to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.00,0:05:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where he's running around and\Nscreaming like an imbecile,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.66,0:05:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you can just relax and take your time
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.22,0:05:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Robin, would you like me to\Nmake you something to warm you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.34,0:05:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have an appetite?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.06,0:05:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do. May I have some\Ncoffee, please? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.34,0:05:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my pleasure
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, this pie and stuff is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.90,0:05:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stop eating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.90,0:05:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet we could make some\Nmoney selling this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.48,0:05:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, come quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.72,0:05:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a frog doing\Nthe front crawl. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.38,0:06:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's headed to your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.75,0:06:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's that\Nsame frog we heard about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.74,0:06:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really going to take anything\Nthat Goofy Admiral told you seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.24,0:06:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way a frog could\Ndo the front crawl if...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.72,0:06:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.66,0:06:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a frog doing the front crawl!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.34,0:06:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.32,0:06:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After him! Aye-aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.10,0:06:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take in the sails!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.28,0:06:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand by the oars!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.38,0:06:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring the ship about two o 'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.32,0:06:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye-aye! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.94,0:06:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but I get the\Nfeeling we really have to follow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.88,0:06:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting, mademoiselles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.92,0:06:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.52,0:06:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like the ship has\Nchanged its course. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.00,0:06:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the deal here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.91,0:06:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you change our\Ncourse without asking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.66,0:06:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, you're never gonna believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.40,0:06:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found this huge frog with scars all\Nover its body, and we're following it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.16,0:06:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A frog? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.64,0:06:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to catch up to it, capture\Nit, cook it, and eat it for lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.46,0:06:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanna eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:06:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.34,0:07:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, is that a lighthouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, what is a lighthouse\Ndoing way out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if anyone lives there. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.14,0:07:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see an island?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.16,0:07:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not really, it's just a lighthouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.68,0:07:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not enough there\Nfor the log to point to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the frog?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.36,0:07:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us which way the frog went!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.30,0:07:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the frog is\Nheaded to the lighthouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.38,0:07:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frogs should be marinated in\Nwhite wine to dissolve the mucus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you coat them with\Nflour and fry them up crisp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.74,0:07:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, snap out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.30,0:07:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the captain says we're\Ngoing after the frog,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.54,0:07:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we really don't have much\Nchoice in the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.00,0:07:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.24,0:07:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.44,0:07:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old feet ahead! Aye aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.56,0:07:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you all going along with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.42,0:07:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.62,0:07:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, don't let it get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.42,0:07:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get up ahead of\Nit and block its course!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.08,0:07:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.40,0:07:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.62,0:08:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we ran ashore or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.18,0:08:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, Robin, say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you two okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.86,0:08:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.34,0:08:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.18,0:08:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.46,0:08:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.84,0:08:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.64,0:08:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, that sounds like a...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.96,0:08:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.70,0:09:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.00,0:09:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full reverse right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.88,0:09:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now turn 180 degrees!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.86,0:09:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that was gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Uncle Metal is trying to kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.90,0:09:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it a ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.12,0:09:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.30,0:09:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something that big and heavy\Nshouldn't even be able to float!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.14,0:09:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.78,0:09:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.92,0:09:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Froggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looked like it was spitting out smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.54,0:10:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.45,0:10:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Granny! Granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.92,0:10:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fuck me, a virus! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.84,0:10:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that true, Timmy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okey-dokey then, in that case, better\Nbring Brook the transponder snail!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.90,0:10:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be a big pain if they call\Nfor help when the Marines show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.34,0:10:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.82,0:10:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it is, Granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:10:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.50,0:10:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.12,0:11:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, you got the wrong number.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.64,0:11:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's totally drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, Paulie, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.54,0:11:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That stuff goes good with booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.36,0:11:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm, yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Chimney.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.52,0:11:17.28,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(647,478)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,400)\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)\t(1360,1405,\1a&HFF&)}Chimney\NKokoro's Grandchild
Dialogue: 2,0:11:15.52,0:11:17.28,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(647,478)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,400)}Chimney\NKokoro's Grandchild
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.90,0:11:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our kitty cat, Gonbe.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.40,0:11:19.24,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(647,478)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,400)\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)\t(1440,1485,\1a&HFF&)}Gonbe\NA Cat (Actually a Rabbit)
Dialogue: 2,0:11:17.40,0:11:19.24,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(647,478)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,400)}Gonbe\NA Cat (Actually a Rabbit)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.70,0:11:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's Granny Kokoro.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.36,0:11:23.53,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(647,478)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,400)\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)\t(3770,3815,\1a&HFF&)}Stationmaster Kokoro\NShift Station
Dialogue: 2,0:11:19.36,0:11:23.53,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(647,478)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,400)}Stationmaster Kokoro\NShift Station
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fellas wouldn't happen to\Nbe train robbers, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.72,0:11:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Luffy, and I'm\Ngonna be king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.92,0:11:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.86,0:11:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like you. You're funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.24,0:11:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, Chimney, that\Nthing's a steamboat, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.78,0:11:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems awfully long to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.00,0:11:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't imagine it getting very far.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've probably never\Nseen anything like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seeing as it's the only one in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.92,0:11:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a steamboat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.18,0:11:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a Sea Train called the Puffing Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.54,0:11:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.84,0:11:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It uses a steam engine to turn its\Npaddle wheels and run on a railway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.06,0:11:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Railway? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.38,0:12:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you look close, you can see\Nthe tracks right below the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.24,0:12:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The train goes the same route every day,\Ntaking people from one island to the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.42,0:12:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It carries ships and packages\Nand other stuff, too. Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.24,0:12:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Funny we didn't notice it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.94,0:12:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you see the signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.30,0:12:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a bell ringing and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.20,0:12:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.60,0:12:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if we couldn't figure it out, then\Nthat frog sure wouldn't get it, would he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.20,0:12:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was awful rude of you\Nto hit him like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.44,0:12:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were going to catch him\Nand cook him, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you saw the frog?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.02,0:12:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Yokozuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.18,0:12:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sure was an awesome swimmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.26,0:12:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, I wouldn't worry about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.06,0:12:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.26,0:12:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, that wasn't the first time\Nhe's challenged the train and lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.16,0:12:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's really kind of a pain\Nif you want to see him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.22,0:12:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hang around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.13,0:12:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it'll pop up\NThat's why he didn't run?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.30,0:12:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.21,0:12:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought that frog was stupid, but it\Nturns out he was just being super manly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.64,0:12:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy for you to say you have to\Nput up with him all the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.82,0:12:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even count how many\Ntimes he's broken the rail!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.00,0:12:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's pretty crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.78,0:12:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, since that frogs a fighter like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.24,0:13:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna eat him\Nafter all Who would want
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.14,0:13:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to eat that gross thing\Nin the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.62,0:13:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyways, after this, where\Nare you folks headed off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.86,0:13:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Sea Train runs to all sorts of places.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.60,0:13:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's the town of the Spring Queen, St.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poplar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.88,0:13:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's the gourmet town, Pucci.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.12,0:13:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or the carnival town, San Faldo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.78,0:13:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all fun places to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.68,0:13:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you happen to\Nwork for the government?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.70,0:13:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can take a special\Ntrain that's even fancier!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.84,0:13:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,than the Puffing Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.14,0:13:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, then that's the\Nplace we're going to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.68,0:13:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.59,0:13:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but there's no reason for us to\Ntake the train when we have our own ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.46,0:13:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just follow the log.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.00,0:13:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, where's it pointing to?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.94,0:13:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should be someplace east of here. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.56,0:13:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, it's Water 7 for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.34,0:13:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The train you saw on the way here just\Ncame from Blue Station on that island.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They call it the City of Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.94,0:13:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got great shipyards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.78,0:13:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might say that's their claim to fame\Nwhen it comes to boats their first class.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.04,0:13:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're always coming\Nup with some fancy new
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.26,0:13:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,technology to build boats\Nfor the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.80,0:14:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa. Then they must have\Nsome awesome shipwrights, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.70,0:14:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,damn near all of them Cities like\Na regular shipwrights convention.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.92,0:14:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.54,0:14:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.48,0:14:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.39,0:14:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then it's settled we're\Ngonna find the best ship
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.32,0:14:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right in Water 7 and get\Nhim to join our crew No,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.20,0:14:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is that so in that case? Hold on a sec
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.84,0:14:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daisy, you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's she going?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.14,0:14:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.64,0:14:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a present for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.34,0:14:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a little map of the\Ncity and a reference letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.56,0:14:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give this to a fellow named Iceberg\Nand I promise he'll fix your ship up good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.62,0:14:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water 7's a pretty confusing place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be sure not to get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.72,0:14:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a big heart, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.92,0:14:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be heading back to Water 7\Nsoon, so maybe we'll see you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.50,0:14:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a plan to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.44,0:14:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you like, I can even give you folks\Na tour of all my favorite Dragon holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.72,0:14:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.72,0:15:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll try to keep a lookout for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.42,0:15:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll take about a week for the\Nlog to lock onto the next island,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.40,0:15:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you'll have plenty of\Ntime to do some sightseeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.63,0:15:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.74,0:15:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,OK, everyone ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.46,0:15:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to set sail! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.36,0:15:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks again for the map\Nand reference letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.64,0:15:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure am glad we ran into you on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.50,0:15:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.40,0:15:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better keep an eye out for all\Nthose government types down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.78,0:15:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.86,0:15:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,City of Meat, here we come!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.56,0:15:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you forget where we're going already?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.82,0:15:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a nice wind, we might make it out\Nto Water 7 even faster than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.60,0:15:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be happy either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.26,0:15:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about finding a\Nshipwright. I got it all under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.34,0:16:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get the hottest\Ngirl in town guaranteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.52,0:16:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I care if the shipwright's hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want a huge manly dude, like even\Nbigger than a bear, 16 feet tall!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.12,0:16:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A guy that size couldn't\Neven fit on the ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and who knows how much\Nfood he would have to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.64,0:16:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that matters is that\Nhe's good at his job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.18,0:16:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you ask me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.09,0:16:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the real problem's gonna\Nbe finding someone crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.82,0:16:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,enough to go sailing\Nwith a bunch of pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.00,0:16:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Size doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.28,0:16:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad we're\Ngonna make a new friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.08,0:16:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're lucky we ran into that\Ntrain station on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.76,0:16:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This map should be a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.30,0:16:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is follow Kokoro's\Ndirections to that Iceburg guy and we're set.
