Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.02,0:16:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't just run, I'd jump into\Nthe sea to get away from that freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.64,0:16:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he looks like he might be part\Noctopus, so even that might not save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.32,0:16:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you have anything\Nbetter to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.40,0:16:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, everybody, since we're gonna\Nbe at Water 7 for a whole week,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.38,0:16:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let me give you your allowance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, me first! Me first!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.48,0:17:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allowance!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.39,0:17:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allowance!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.31,0:17:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allowance! Allowance!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.80,0:17:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you hugging the shampoos up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.96,0:17:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know all these tin plates\Nmay not look like much to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.60,0:17:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they bring back a lot\Nof fond memories for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.26,0:17:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost hate to see them go,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.86,0:17:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it'll all be worth it if the Mary\Ncan finally get the repairs she needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.96,0:17:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.64,0:17:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of her battle\Nscars like anyone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but she's taken a real beating\Nsince we've entered the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.44,0:17:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The deck creaks and we've got\Nleaks popping up everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.86,0:17:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody wants to admit it but if we don't\Nfix this soon we're as good as some.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.84,0:17:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah but even if we can't get a ship\Nright for the crew we still have
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.86,0:17:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,plenty of money we can do more than\Njust fix her we can power her up too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.66,0:17:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh then let's get more cannons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.50,0:17:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah and a big statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.62,0:17:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey I think we're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:18:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right. I can see Water 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, men! Time to roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.68,0:18:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The winds enough don't wear us\Nout before we even get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.70,0:18:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.20,0:18:29.08,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,409)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,400)\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)\t(4480,4525,\1a&HFF&)}Water Seven\N"The City of Water"\NGrand Line
Dialogue: 2,0:18:24.20,0:18:29.08,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,409)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,400)}Water Seven\N"The City of Water"\NGrand Line
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.62,0:18:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody told me it was gonna be this cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, check that thing out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.58,0:18:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know they made\Nfountains that big!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.20,0:18:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.82,0:18:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I thought the sea\Ntrain was a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.74,0:18:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At any rate, that's the station up front.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.36,0:18:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be the same one\NKokoro was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.96,0:18:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, I wonder where the harbor's at.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.76,0:18:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inside the town, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.28,0:18:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.36,0:19:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates shouldn't sail in the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.18,0:19:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta be more discreet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use the back street\Nentrance over there instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.68,0:19:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.38,0:19:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, look, there's so many boats.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.16,0:19:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome, the city's floating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.48,0:19:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wonder how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.20,0:19:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But everything's flooded everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.46,0:19:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't all the buildings\Ngonna be full of water too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.00,0:19:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The houses here were built with\Na submerged foundation in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.48,0:19:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.39,0:19:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you look beneath the\Nwalkway, you'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.94,0:19:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.90,0:19:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like the city's sitting on stilts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.96,0:19:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.87,0:19:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Certainly lives up to its name. Whoa! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:51.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, dock the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.88,0:19:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.79,0:19:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.86,0:19:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you pirates think\Nyou're doing here in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:20:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're not looking\Nto plunder now, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.66,0:20:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.57,0:20:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just want to get our ship repaired!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.26,0:20:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just asked that like it's no big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.32,0:20:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, there's a little\Ncape just ahead of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.46,0:20:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anchor your ship over there for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.56,0:20:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.47,0:20:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the help!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.56,0:20:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They keep waving us off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.12,0:20:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.18,0:20:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll fly on a pirate flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.02,0:20:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.93,0:20:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should be okay to anchor here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.68,0:20:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't see why not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.10,0:20:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's certainly far enough from the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.96,0:20:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Works for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.96,0:20:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For all the sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.74,0:20:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.65,0:20:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to break the ship? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.60,0:20:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I did was pull the\Nrope like I always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.30,0:20:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.44,0:20:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the Mary's falling apart this easy,\Nwe're lucky we made it here at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, they're not scared\Nof pirates here, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.26,0:20:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that's kind of strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.74,0:20:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because we're shipyard\Ncustomers just like anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.62,0:20:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop yapping and start\Nfixing the ship already!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.44,0:21:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They probably aren't concerned\Nabout pirates because they
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.72,0:21:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have enough security to deal\Nwith them if they misbehave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.36,0:21:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bet there's plenty of Marines here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.34,0:21:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Comes with the territory, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.90,0:21:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, are you kidding me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.30,0:21:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean they're gonna have us arrested?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.04,0:21:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think that'll be a problem\Nsince we're paying customers and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.98,0:21:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.38,0:21:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.60,0:21:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.51,0:21:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on one minute, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.52,0:21:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.14,0:21:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to come with me to\Ntake care of some business.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.92,0:21:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.08,0:21:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What business?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.99,0:21:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First off, we're going to take Kokoro's\Nreference letter to this Iceburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.98,0:21:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,assuming we can find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.28,0:21:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopefully, he'll be able to take\Ncare of the Mary's repairs for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.36,0:21:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.27,0:21:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll have to find a place where we\Ncan trade in our gold for some berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.30,0:21:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okie Dock, works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.62,0:21:40.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.32,0:21:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go to Water 7!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.82,0:21:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but aren't you forgetting the gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.20,0:21:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.11,0:21:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some pirates are causing\Na ruckus at Doc 1!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.28,0:21:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.19,0:21:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.11,0:21:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we better go check this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.56,0:21:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you're not making any sense.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.62,0:21:59.50,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(167,381)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,400)\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)\t(3480,3525,\1a&HFF&)}{Shipbuilding Factory}A Dockyard\NWater Seven
Dialogue: 2,0:21:55.62,0:21:59.50,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(167,381)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,400)}{Shipbuilding Factory}A Dockyard\NWater Seven
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.06,0:21:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need me to talk slow for you?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.58,0:22:03.51,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(139,371)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)}Dock One
Dialogue: 2,0:21:59.58,0:22:03.51,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(139,371)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)}Dock One
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.59,0:22:09.09,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,407)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,400)\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)\t(5100,5145,\1a&HFF&)}Captain Mikazuki\NBig Helmet Pirates\NBounty: 36 Million Belly
Dialogue: 2,0:22:03.59,0:22:09.09,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,407)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,400)}Captain Mikazuki\NBig Helmet Pirates\NBounty: 36 Million Belly
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.18,0:22:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you repaired our ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.64,0:22:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, then I got to thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.38,0:22:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And no matter how I looked at it,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.18,0:22:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no matter how many times I turned\Nour little deal around in my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.92,0:22:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still felt like you were\Ncharging me way too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.90,0:22:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're interrupting our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.36,0:22:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.52,0:22:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not paying a single\Nberry for the work you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.86,0:22:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the repairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.50,0:22:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were great!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.56,0:22:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So kind of you to do them for free!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.30,0:22:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Cauliflower, you\Nknow what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.74,0:22:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mr. Iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.00,0:22:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those pirates are Doc One customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.96,0:22:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now that the work's\Ndone, they refuse to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.58,0:22:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sexual harassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.68,0:22:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.72,0:23:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, sir, we take\Nour jobs very seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.32,0:23:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not wise to mark\Nour shipwrites like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.50,0:23:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.58,0:23:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,COMPTON!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.94,0:23:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops! Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.00,0:23:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch where you swing that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.76,0:23:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just knocked out a...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.58,0:23:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.48,0:23:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you punks trying to pick a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.02,0:23:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.76,0:23:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.02,0:23:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't had a chance to\Ntest-fire that cannon, have we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.82,0:24:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.00,0:24:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.08,0:24:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.72,0:24:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be back! Just when!
Dialogue: 1,0:24:23.35,0:24:28.86,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,407)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)}Galley-La Company\NA Shipbuilding Firm, Water Seven\N(Purveyors to the World Government)
Dialogue: 2,0:24:23.35,0:24:28.86,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,407)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)}Galley-La Company\NA Shipbuilding Firm, Water Seven\N(Purveyors to the World Government)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.56,0:24:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're out, shipwrecker.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.24,0:24:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what happens when you try to\Npull that pirate crap around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.38,0:24:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should trade in the\Ngold before anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.96,0:24:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.87,0:24:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to go to the shipyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.18,0:24:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might not matter to you, but I'd feel\Nnervous walking around a crowded city!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.72,0:24:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dragging a giant bag\Nof treasure behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.94,0:24:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we trade it, we'd still\Nbe dragging berries around.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.50,0:24:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but it'll be a lot smaller\Nso people won't notice it as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.76,0:24:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, what if we run into thieves?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.86,0:24:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.77,0:24:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are thieves!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.69,0:24:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.84,0:24:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we cash it in, you won't be\Nthe only one carrying the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.54,0:24:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.54,0:25:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost like you don't want\Nme taking care of the gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.14,0:25:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.05,0:25:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only you could lose that much gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.72,0:25:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He already forgot it once today.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.84,0:25:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys don't trust me,\Nyour own captain? Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.96,0:25:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, hey, that really hurts my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.06,0:25:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can keep\Nsailing with a crew that...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.38,0:25:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.84,0:25:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, that's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.60,0:25:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the only entrance to the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.24,0:25:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's a rental bull shop? Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.46,0:25:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously, they must rent out something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.42,0:25:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what's a bull?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.78,0:25:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.69,0:25:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a bulldog?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.52,0:25:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.02,0:25:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, we'd like to rent some bulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.56,0:25:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find out what they are first.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.64,0:25:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.55,0:25:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, looking for some bulls, you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.14,0:25:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many people? We've got three.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.60,0:25:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind would you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.84,0:25:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's three ranks,\NYagada, Rabaka, and King.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.06,0:25:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For your little group, I'm thinking\Ntwo Yagadas will do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.38,0:25:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me one rare and one well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.26,0:25:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know what you're saying, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.50,0:25:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.41,0:25:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You followed a log to get here? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.12,0:25:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's quite an achievement, but\Nif you're not from around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.66,0:26:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is probably the first time\Nyou've ever heard about bulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.36,0:26:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, to make a long story short,\Nthere they are, Yagada bulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.46,0:26:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can find them all over town.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.26,0:26:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can see, it's a type of fish that\Nswims with its head above the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.18,0:26:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since the whole city is flooded, we\Nhave a lot more canals than walkways.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.08,0:26:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.99,0:26:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pretty much everyone around here\Nuses the bulls in their daily life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.10,0:26:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to go sightseeing,\Nyou'll need one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.84,0:26:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they use the bulls to\Npull those little boats?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.26,0:26:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, the boat parts\Nmounted on their back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.64,0:26:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, it's not much different\Nthan riding horseback on land.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.52,0:26:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and take a look at the bullpen\Nover there if you want to pick one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.86,0:26:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.46,0:26:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be 2,000 berries for\Ntwo two-passenger yogatas.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.36,0:26:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, they're cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.92,0:26:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They even look like horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.98,0:26:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.18,0:26:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you, horsefish?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.78,0:26:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.69,0:26:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since that one seems to like\Nyou, I'll mount him for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.30,0:27:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he all right carrying heavy stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.36,0:27:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, these guys are built for power.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.16,0:27:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people here use them\Nfor moving all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.78,0:27:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a big bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.10,0:27:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I ask what's inside? Gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.22,0:27:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.30,0:27:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever it is, it'll be okay. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.00,0:27:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, gimme! Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.06,0:27:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess he thought it was\Nworth asking, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.28,0:27:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is why I said I don't\Ntrust you with the money!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.68,0:27:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to show him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.00,0:27:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.10,0:27:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I sure wasn't expecting that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.10,0:27:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, that'll be one million\Nberries for two yogurtables.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.84,0:27:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't try to change the price on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.46,0:27:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of gold, do you know\Nwhere we can get ours cashed in?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.56,0:27:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there's quite a few places, but\Nyou'd probably clean them all out!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.60,0:27:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trying to trade in that\Nmuch treasure in one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.02,0:27:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were you, I'd check out\Ndowntown on the Shipbuilders Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.24,0:27:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not really familiar with the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.32,0:27:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think you could give us some directions?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.52,0:27:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.78,0:27:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.08,0:27:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, a map!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.34,0:27:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the help!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.66,0:27:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we could find a\Nshipyard downtown too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.58,0:27:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, best one in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.36,0:27:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll be perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.18,0:28:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can head straight to the shipyard\Nsoon as we trade in our gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.14,0:28:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're not going to\Nhear any complaints from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.00,0:28:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as the Mary gets\Nrepaired, I'll be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.10,0:28:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll find a ship ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.46,0:28:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.37,0:28:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I can't wait!\NWell? Shall we? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.84,0:28:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.44,0:28:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.92,0:28:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your business\Nand have a safe trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.38,0:28:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Downtown!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.40,0:28:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.16,0:28:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
